      "text": "Erenumab:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " monitor for severe constipation (drugs that decrease GI motility may raise the risk) and for new-onset or worsening hypertension."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
