    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "New, recurrent or worsening Raynaud's phenomenon has been reported with CGRP antagonists, including erenumab; stop it if signs or symptoms develop."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
